1840
01:10:33,062 --> 01:10:34,462
For dinner,

1841
01:10:34,822 --> 01:10:36,192
I need to make something.

1842
01:10:36,492 --> 01:10:38,431
- I needed to serve them well. - Right.

1843
01:10:38,432 --> 01:10:39,962
- You don't do it half-heartedly. - Oh, you're making something?

1844
01:10:40,102 --> 01:10:42,061
Why on earth do you have this at home?

1845
01:10:42,062 --> 01:10:43,101
What is this?

1846
01:10:43,102 --> 01:10:44,671
Oh, my stuff...

1847
01:10:44,672 --> 01:10:45,871
- What? - Why do you have the delivery box?

1848
01:10:45,872 --> 01:10:46,872
Look at this.

1849
01:10:48,342 --> 01:10:49,572
- What is it? - I use it to move things at once.

1850
01:10:50,012 --> 01:10:52,871
It's difficult to go back and forth.

1851
01:10:52,872 --> 01:10:54,181
(An all-in-one delivery box to move stuff around)

1852
01:10:54,182 --> 01:10:55,511
Because I use both floors...

1853
01:10:55,512 --> 01:10:56,711
Because it's inconvenient to move things upstairs?

1854
01:10:56,712 --> 01:10:58,111
- Exactly. - I see.

1855
01:10:58,112 --> 01:10:59,152
- He's right. - Let's go.

1856
01:11:01,522 --> 01:11:02,522
Be careful.

1857
01:11:02,523 --> 01:11:03,651
(Careful)

1858
01:11:03,652 --> 01:11:04,652
Gosh.

1859
01:11:05,492 --> 01:11:07,961
(They're back at house number 2.)

1860
01:11:07,962 --> 01:11:09,322
Gosh, I'm so sick of this.

1861
01:11:09,422 --> 01:11:10,492
Seriously.

1862
01:11:11,292 --> 01:11:14,101
Yes, that. There's oyster in the fridge.

1863
01:11:14,102 --> 01:11:15,162
- There is oyster? - Yes.

1864
01:11:15,402 --> 01:11:16,402
Where?

1865
01:11:16,702 --> 01:11:18,231
Since it's the New Year,

1866
01:11:18,232 --> 01:11:19,801
I'm going to make oyster maesaengi rice cake soup with dumplings,

1867
01:11:19,802 --> 01:11:21,372
using the ingredients in season.

1868
01:11:22,272 --> 01:11:23,672
When I was in school,

1869
01:11:24,442 --> 01:11:26,371
I'd visit Yangpyeong on January 1.

1870
01:11:26,372 --> 01:11:27,541
There's a mountain there too,

1871
01:11:27,542 --> 01:11:30,752
so we'd go up and see the sunrise. When we came down,

1872
01:11:30,952 --> 01:11:33,651
