1873
01:11:33,652 --> 01:11:34,751
to welcome the New Year.

1874
01:11:34,752 --> 01:11:36,352
We'd eat together at home.

1875
01:11:36,552 --> 01:11:38,521
I used to sit next to them...

1876
01:11:38,522 --> 01:11:39,652
and make it together.

1877
01:11:39,722 --> 01:11:41,991
I wanted to bring back that memory.

1878
01:11:41,992 --> 01:11:43,931
I decided to make rice cake soup with dumplings...

1879
01:11:43,932 --> 01:11:45,862
- to make it meaningful. - Rice cake soup with dumplings.

1880
01:11:46,162 --> 01:11:47,262
Since it's the New Year.

1881
01:11:48,262 --> 01:11:50,731
(Putting it in right away)

1882
01:11:50,732 --> 01:11:52,901
Shouldn't you separate the rice cakes before putting them in?

1883
01:11:52,902 --> 01:11:54,302
No, I can just...

1884
01:11:54,772 --> 01:11:55,842
stir it.

1885
01:11:55,872 --> 01:11:56,972
"Stir it?"

1886
01:11:57,772 --> 01:11:59,841
Hey, be glad he didn't add the whole rice cake stick.

1887
01:11:59,842 --> 01:12:01,312
(Let's trust Dae Ho and wait.)

1888
01:12:01,812 --> 01:12:03,041
Dae Ho, you know what we like.

1889
01:12:03,042 --> 01:12:04,081
- Yes, I do. - Put everything in at once...

1890
01:12:04,082 --> 01:12:05,111
and boil it.

1891
01:12:05,112 --> 01:12:06,151
- Right. - Not separately.

1892
01:12:06,152 --> 01:12:07,222
That's for sure.

1893
01:12:08,122 --> 01:12:09,122
That's it. I just need to boil it now.

1894
01:12:09,182 --> 01:12:11,192
I think it'll be delicious. It smells good.

1895
01:12:11,922 --> 01:12:14,192
Now, we have an important agenda.

1896
01:12:14,892 --> 01:12:16,592
We have an important agenda.

1897
01:12:17,762 --> 01:12:18,831
I should cut this and use it.

1898
01:12:18,832 --> 01:12:19,861
