1899
01:12:19,862 --> 01:12:21,161
- This... - What shall we do?

1900
01:12:21,162 --> 01:12:22,531
Cut it into pieces according to the number of people.

1901
01:12:22,532 --> 01:12:23,532
Cut it into five pieces.

1902
