I'll draw it from here.

1930
01:13:21,262 --> 01:13:22,291
(He draws lots inside the delivery box.)

1931
01:13:22,292 --> 01:13:23,862
- That's state-of-the-art. - The delivery box.

1932
01:13:24,192 --> 01:13:25,231
- I drew one. - Drum roll.

1933
01:13:25,232 --> 01:13:27,601
