Since there are 5 of you, I'll go for 5th place first.

1935
01:13:29,662 --> 01:13:31,102
A lucky draw is the most fun.

1936
01:13:31,232 --> 01:13:34,372
There's nothing else that lifts the mood like a lucky draw.

1937
01:13:36,612 --> 01:13:38,572
