1938
01:13:39,242 --> 01:13:40,841
We're nervous because of this.

1939
01:13:40,842 --> 01:13:42,441
We're hoping not to get that.

1940
01:13:42,442 --> 01:13:44,652
I hope it's not my name.

1941
01:13:45,682 --> 01:13:47,121
