1955
01:14:19,052 --> 01:14:20,081
(Is that so?)

1956
01:14:20,082 --> 01:14:21,251
Congratulations.

1957
01:14:21,252 --> 01:14:22,681
- It's beef jerky. - It's beef jerky.

1958
01:14:22,682 --> 01:14:24,292
