1963
01:14:31,292 --> 01:14:32,991
But the gift for fifth place...

1964
01:14:32,992 --> 01:14:34,661
- isn't so bad. - It's not bad.

1965
01:14:34,662 --> 01:14:35,701
You're right.

1966
01:14:35,702 --> 01:14:36,702
- The next gift. - That's not true.

1967
01:14:36,703 --> 01:14:38,672
