2088
01:18:25,462 --> 01:18:28,301
Dae Ho, you prepared a lot.

2089
01:18:28,302 --> 01:18:29,302
He became sweet...

2090
01:18:29,302 --> 01:18:30,302
- after winning the wallet. - Right?

2091
01:18:33,072 --> 01:18:34,101
