2092
01:18:34,102 --> 01:18:35,102
Maesaengi.

2093
01:18:36,402 --> 01:18:38,171
- It looks good. - It looks so good, though.

2094
01:18:38,172 --> 01:18:39,342
Dae Ho is a good cook.

2095
01:18:40,412 --> 01:18:42,381
- Thank you for the food. - Thank you for the food. Enjoy.

2096
01:18:42,382 --> 01:18:44,352
Gosh, I get to have rice cake soup only now.

2097
01:18:45,482 --> 01:18:49,082
(The eldest tries the soup first.)

2098
01:18:49,522 --> 01:18:50,522
(Grunting)

2099
01:18:50,852 --> 01:18:51,852
Maesaengi rice cake soup.

2100
01:18:51,952 --> 01:18:54,221
