2101
01:18:54,222 --> 01:18:55,292
Goodness.

2102
01:18:55,422 --> 01:18:56,721
- How does it taste so good? - It's good.

2103
01:18:56,722 --> 01:18:58,291
- How does it taste so good? - It's good.

2104
01:18:58,292 --> 01:18:59,332
- It's really good. - It's good.

2105
01:19:01,362 --> 01:19:02,632
That's the most well-received.

2106
01:19:02,702 --> 01:19:04,632
Everyone's warmed up by it.

2107
01:19:05,102 --> 01:19:07,102
It's incredible as it has maesaengi.

2108
01:19:07,572 --> 01:19:09,872
It's so good. It's refreshing.

2109
01:19:10,172 --> 01:19:11,471
- It's good. - How does it taste so good?

2110
01:19:11,472 --> 01:19:12,512
It's good.

2111
01:19:13,272 --> 01:19:14,812
It's like having a meal during the holiday after ancestral rites.

2112
01:19:15,282 --> 01:19:17,282
We'd gather like this and eat.

2113
01:19:17,912 --> 01:19:19,981
- I know. - This sight is kind of cute.

2114
01:19:19,982 --> 01:19:21,622
I know, right? It's so...

2115
01:19:22,582 --> 01:19:25,021
(Inhaling without a break)

2116
01:19:25,022 --> 01:19:26,322
It's been a while since I enjoyed rice cake soup.

2117
01:19:27,492 --> 01:19:29,591
Fortunately, they emptied their bowls.

2118
01:19:29,592 --> 01:19:31,032
It must've been really good.

2119
01:19:31,092 --> 01:19:32,492
They must've been tired.

2120
01:19:34,862 --> 01:19:38,232
