2121
01:19:41,102 --> 01:19:42,602
Dae Ho prepared many things today.

2122
01:19:43,372 --> 01:19:46,142
It feels different to see you here instead of Yangpyeong.

2123
01:19:46,372 --> 01:19:48,881
When else will we get a chance to gather in Seoul...

2124
01:19:48,882 --> 01:19:50,411
