2125
01:19:50,412 --> 01:19:52,181
Right. The gathering itself is nice.

2126
01:19:52,182 --> 01:19:54,951
Jung Ho prepared my father's 70th birthday party too.

2127
01:19:54,952 --> 01:19:56,052
- I see - Right.

2128
01:19:56,322 --> 01:19:59,352
When I went, my parents looked so happy.

2129
01:19:59,522 --> 01:20:00,992
My mom was really happy.

2130
01:20:01,162 --> 01:20:03,461
So I thought, "Did I think too complacently about it?"

2131
01:20:03,462 --> 01:20:04,662
I got such thoughts.

2132
01:20:05,162 --> 01:20:06,962
- It's because I have experience. - Exactly.

2133
01:20:07,532 --> 01:20:10,631
Our parents might say that they don't want it,

2134
01:20:10,632 --> 01:20:13,102
