2135
01:20:13,402 --> 01:20:14,941
- But it's not what we should do. - Right.

2136
01:20:14,942 --> 01:20:16,401
We need to hold them a party,

2137
01:20:16,402 --> 01:20:17,771
- so it lasts in our memory. - That's right.

2138
01:20:17,772 --> 01:20:19,371
Actually, a lot more family members...

2139
01:20:19,372 --> 01:20:20,982
gathered for his 70th birthday party.

2140
01:20:21,442 --> 01:20:23,541
- My dad choked up too. - That's right.

2141
01:20:23,542 --> 01:20:24,681
When he talked...

2142
01:20:24,682 --> 01:20:27,651
My dad... He's not the type to cry. I've never seen him cry.

2143
01:20:27,652 --> 01:20:29,322
He's a Thinking type.

2144
01:20:29,552 --> 01:20:30,991
He barely managed to talk.

2145
01:20:30,992 --> 01:20:32,191
(Gosh, he barely managed to talk.)

2146
01:20:32,192 --> 01:20:34,861
If he went on a bit more, he'd have cried his eyes out.

2147
01:20:34,862 --> 01:20:36,162
I was really surprised.

2148
01:20:36,762 --> 01:20:38,862
I felt really grateful to Jung Ho.

2149
01:20:39,092 --> 01:20:43,032
He's been taking care of us both materially and emotionally.

2150
01:20:43,332 --> 01:20:48,142
Also, he always spared his time for us...

2151
01:20:48,472 --> 01:20:49,671
and led us.

2152
01:20:49,672 --> 01:20:53,311
I actually prepared this trip to thank Jung Ho.

2153
01:20:53,312 --> 01:20:56,182
Should I turn on some music for the background?

2154
01:20:56,282 --> 01:20:57,282
That's why we're gathered, actually.

2155
01:20:57,283 --> 01:20:59,512
- I wanted to express my gratitude. - That's right.

2156
01:21:00,082 --> 01:21:01,652
- So... - I agree.

2157
01:21:01,922 --> 01:21:03,022
Actually...

2158
01:21:03,892 --> 01:21:04,892
Earlier...

2159
01:21:04,892 --> 01:21:05,892
