2161
01:21:09,862 --> 01:21:11,792
I wrote something for him, letter by letter.

2162
01:21:12,532 --> 01:21:14,202
- A letter? - Gosh, he prepared that too.

2163
01:21:14,362 --> 01:21:15,531
(Goodness, he's seriously...)

2164
01:21:15,532 --> 01:21:16,962
Shin Ho, turn on some music.

2165
01:21:18,532 --> 01:21:20,072
It's nothing much.

2166
01:21:21,372 --> 01:21:22,602
(Focused)

2167
01:21:23,672 --> 01:21:26,141
- Darn. I don't think I can read it. - Come on.

2168
01:21:26,142 --> 01:21:28,181
After he got over 40...

2169
01:21:28,182 --> 01:21:29,441
Why would you cry?

2170
01:21:29,442 --> 01:21:31,181
He became strange after he got over 40.

2171
01:21:31,182 --> 01:21:32,281
You really are sentimental.

2172
01:21:32,282 --> 01:21:34,082
I'm the Feeling type. Don't.

2173
01:21:36,152 --> 01:21:37,522
- First of all... - He's reading it.

2174
01:21:37,992 --> 01:21:39,521
"Dear my beloved cousins."

2175
01:21:39,522 --> 01:21:41,792
(Dear my beloved cousins.)

2176
01:21:42,662 --> 01:21:45,662
"Thank you for always keeping my side like actual brothers."

2177
01:21:48,362 --> 01:21:50,261
"Whenever I went to Yangpyeong during the holiday..."

2178
01:21:50,262 --> 01:21:51,332
"when I was young,"

2179
01:21:52,732 --> 01:21:53,971
"I didn't want to go back home,"

2180
01:21:53,972 --> 01:21:56,401
"so I remember how I always cried and threw a tantrum."

2181
01:21:56,402 --> 01:21:57,712
What's wrong with me?

2182
01:21:59,272 --> 01:22:01,312
"During summer, we'd cook by the stream,"

2183
01:22:01,512 --> 01:22:03,812
"have baeksuk, and swim together."

2184
01:22:04,752 --> 01:22:07,282
"During winter, we'd play soccer on the frozen Yonggol Stream."

2185
01:22:08,752 --> 01:22:10,351
"I miss the time when we hung out together,"

2186
01:22:10,352 --> 01:22:11,521
"going from this mountain to that."

2187
01:22:11,522 --> 01:22:12,991
(I miss that time.)

2188
01:22:12,992 --> 01:22:14,462
Darn, I wasn't going to cry.

2189
01:22:16,462 --> 01:22:19,261
(Even if he tries to fight it off, he can't help but get teary.)

2190
01:22:19,262 --> 01:22:21,302
- It's so sudden. - What do we do?

2191
01:22:22,302 --> 01:22:23,932
What? He's crying?

2192
01:22:25,102 --> 01:22:27,141
(Holding back their laugh)

2193
01:22:27,142 --> 01:22:28,171
(Hanging his head)

2194
01:22:28,172 --> 01:22:30,412
Why are you laughing, CODE KUNST?

2195
01:22:30,672 --> 01:22:32,771
It's a very touching moment.

2196
01:22:32,772 --> 01:22:34,542
The genre changes so fast.

2197
01:22:35,042 --> 01:22:36,111
- I mean... - The genre changed like this.

2198
01:22:36,112 --> 01:22:37,752
What are you doing all of a sudden while having rice cake soup?

2199
01:22:37,882 --> 01:22:39,381
It's because there was no build-up.

2200
01:22:39,382 --> 01:22:41,751
It switched all of a sudden. He did the same before.

2201
01:22:41,752 --> 01:22:43,952
- It's the same vibe from before. - I know.

2202
01:22:44,222 --> 01:22:46,592
Why does it make me laugh so much whenever Dae Ho cries?

2203
01:22:47,862 --> 01:22:51,132
Once I can't stop controlling my tears,

2204
01:22:51,932 --> 01:22:53,731
