2205
01:22:53,732 --> 01:22:54,961
- Right. - You must get immersed really fast.

2206
01:22:54,962 --> 01:22:56,162
Well, this is...

2207
01:22:56,762 --> 01:22:57,771
His eyes are really red.

2208
01:22:57,772 --> 01:22:58,871
I think you're going through andropause.

2209
01:22:58,872 --> 01:23:00,102
