2212
01:23:12,612 --> 01:23:13,752
- "Now..." - Stop it.

2213
01:23:14,422 --> 01:23:15,452
Gosh.

2214
01:23:15,982 --> 01:23:17,051
(The brothers are choked up as they're grateful toward the eldest.)

2215
01:23:17,052 --> 01:23:18,922
- They're all so warmhearted. - Goodness.

2216
01:23:19,952 --> 01:23:21,422
"Now that you're aged,"

2217
01:23:21,862 --> 01:23:24,662
