2218
01:23:26,462 --> 01:23:28,632
"We'll support you from now."

2219
01:23:30,532 --> 01:23:31,931
"You can pass out all you want."

2220
01:23:31,932 --> 01:23:34,472
(You can pass out all you want.)

2221
01:23:37,242 --> 01:23:38,541
They're really simple sentences.

2222
01:23:38,542 --> 01:23:41,712
In a way, it's a sequence of words.

2223
01:23:41,842 --> 01:23:43,982
It looked like a young kid's journal even to me.

2224
01:23:44,612 --> 01:23:45,682
But...

2225
01:23:46,552 --> 01:23:48,282
my cousins know how I feel toward them.

2226
01:23:50,052 --> 01:23:51,191
I guess that's why they cried with me.

2227
01:23:51,192 --> 01:23:53,421
(That must be why they cried with me.)

2228
01:23:53,422 --> 01:23:54,622
I'm not going to cry.

2229
01:23:55,992 --> 01:23:58,431
You must've had a cherished childhood.

2230
01:23:58,432 --> 01:24:00,832
I'm really grateful.

2231
01:24:01,902 --> 01:24:02,932
I mean, Gun Ho...

2232
01:24:03,732 --> 01:24:05,172
