2241
01:24:26,792 --> 01:24:27,862
I love you guys.

2242
01:24:29,122 --> 01:24:31,261
- Thank you. - I love you guys.

2243
01:24:31,262 --> 01:24:33,492
- Goodness, how heartwarming. - So...

2244
