2250
01:24:45,872 --> 01:24:46,942
Wait a minute.

2251
01:24:47,612 --> 01:24:49,542
I barely held on, but I can't anymore.

2252
01:24:49,642 --> 01:24:50,782
He's the happiest now.

2253
01:24:51,582 --> 01:24:53,411
So, I sincerely...

2254
01:24:53,412 --> 01:24:54,681
Dae Ho is really thoughtful.

2255
01:24:54,682 --> 01:24:55,821
- I'm really grateful for you. - He's my brother,

2256
01:24:55,822 --> 01:24:56,822
but he's really thoughtful.

2257
01:24:57,322 --> 01:24:59,592
Jung Ho, stay healthy.

2258
01:25:00,022 --> 01:25:01,492
Thank you. I love you.

2259
01:25:02,362 --> 01:25:04,692
- How nice. This is nice. - Yes, it's really nice.

2260
01:25:04,832 --> 01:25:06,692
I swear that...

2261
01:25:07,532 --> 01:25:09,102
I will keep this...

2262
01:25:10,032 --> 01:25:11,602
until the day I die.

2263
01:25:11,872 --> 01:25:13,002
Thanks, Dae Ho.

2264
01:25:13,632 --> 01:25:14,702
Thank you.

2265
01:25:15,642 --> 01:25:17,071
(They express their heartfelt feelings through a hug.)

2266
01:25:17,072 --> 01:25:18,512
Gosh, that was funny.

2267
01:25:19,172 --> 01:25:20,682
I can't believe a day like this came.

2268
01:25:21,782 --> 01:25:24,082
- Gosh. - I'm envious.

2269
01:25:24,712 --> 01:25:26,151
