2270
01:25:26,152 --> 01:25:27,551
- It's quite thick. - It differs in thickness.

2271
01:25:27,552 --> 01:25:28,552
Let me see.

2272
01:25:30,522 --> 01:25:31,852
Jung Ho...

2273
01:25:33,792 --> 01:25:35,391
- How nice. - It's pretty.

2274
01:25:35,392 --> 01:25:36,421
- It's pretty. - It's a wallet.

2275
01:25:36,422 --> 01:25:38,092
It's pretty. The inside is pretty.

2276
01:25:38,892 --> 01:25:40,831
