2279
01:25:45,872 --> 01:25:48,142
(My champion!)

2280
01:25:48,772 --> 01:25:49,801
(Yes!)

2281
01:25:49,802 --> 01:25:52,512
- He's exhilarated. - This is really sweet.

2282
01:25:53,072 --> 01:25:55,011
This is the best. Jung Ho...

2283
01:25:55,012 --> 01:25:57,011
- You won the Grand Prize. - You're right.

2284
01:25:57,012 --> 01:26:00,782
This completely washed away today's fatigue.

2285
01:26:00,852 --> 01:26:01,951
How could you get a Bottega Veneta wallet...

2286
