2295
01:26:20,302 --> 01:26:22,241
Your face looks so different from earlier.

2296
01:26:22,242 --> 01:26:23,402
(Laughing)

2297
01:26:24,542 --> 01:26:25,841
He's so different from when Dae Ho...

2298
01:26:25,842 --> 01:26:27,112
- was reading a letter. - Let me tell you this again.

2299
01:26:27,782 --> 01:26:28,841
- Thank you. - All right.

2300
01:26:28,842 --> 01:26:30,042
