2304
01:26:36,282 --> 01:26:37,452
- Yutnori? - Yutnori.

2305
01:26:37,822 --> 01:26:39,422
(Yes!)

2306
01:26:39,522 --> 01:26:40,761
(Gosh)

2307
01:26:40,762 --> 01:26:41,991
