2309
01:26:43,062 --> 01:26:45,032
- This is so nice. - Take that piece as well.

2310
01:26:45,332 --> 01:26:46,961
(Next story)

2311
01:26:46,962 --> 01:26:47,962
(Panting)

2312
01:26:48,462 --> 01:26:49,462
(Sighing)

2313
01:26:50,032 --> 01:26:52,602
