2314
01:26:53,502 --> 01:26:56,541
(Today is the day they're going to hike...)

2315
01:26:56,542 --> 01:26:58,042
(to welcome the New Year.)

2316
01:26:58,912 --> 01:27:01,842
(Dowoon, Kian84's top customer during the Grand Rainbow Bazaar)

2317
01:27:02,082 --> 01:27:03,082
(Happy)

2318
01:27:04,052 --> 01:27:05,251
