2319
01:27:05,252 --> 01:27:06,952
(I like hiking too.)

2320
01:27:07,522 --> 01:27:09,522
(Of course, I like you too.)

2321
01:27:09,682 --> 01:27:10,851
(You and I have the same vibe.)

2322
01:27:10,852 --> 01:27:12,322
(We have the same wavelength.)

2323
01:27:12,892 --> 01:27:14,191
(Let's go fishing together too.)

2324
01:27:14,192 --> 01:27:15,462
(I'd love to. Why don't we go on freshwater fishing?)

2325
01:27:15,792 --> 01:27:17,662
(Our happy time)

2326
01:27:23,132 --> 01:27:24,502
