2329
01:27:29,502 --> 01:27:31,042
Hey! It's the peak!

2330
01:27:31,342 --> 01:27:33,442
(The sunrise is still far off.)

2331
01:27:34,342 --> 01:27:36,442
(I brought this for you.)

2332
01:27:36,682 --> 01:27:37,682
(Moved)

2333
01:27:37,683 --> 01:27:39,312
(Gosh, it's warm.)

2334
01:27:39,552 --> 01:27:42,052
(Cold is easier to bear when shared,)

2335
01:27:42,552 --> 01:27:44,351
